description: Conventions for this Nextra MDX wiki — defers to AGENTS.md
globs: content/**/*.mdx,content/**/_meta.ts,lib/wiki.ts,site.config.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

The canonical guidance is in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Read it for the full
workflow. When editing files matched by this rule:

- One `#` H1 per page; frontmatter needs `title` + `description`, prefer `status`, and put
  `<StatusBadge status="…" />` next to the H1. `<StatusBadge>` and `<Decision>` are
  auto-injected — no import.
- File names are kebab-case `.mdx`; ADRs are zero-padded (`0001-…`). Copy skeletons from
  `templates/`.
- Internal links are absolute (`/product/overview`), never relative.
- Add new pages to the folder's `_meta.ts` so they appear in the sidebar.
- Mermaid for flows ≥3 steps; mind the gotchas in `content/operations/style-guide.mdx`.
- `pnpm build` is the validation gate. Never hand-edit the generated `/llms.txt` or
  `/llms-full.txt`.
